<h2>What's New</h2>
<ul>
    <li>VoiceOver names the launcher search field after you type, and names each Settings Reset button by the row it clears.</li>
    <li>A badge of one reads as "notification", and a single grouped window reads as "window".</li>
    <li>The bar, launcher, and app switcher have spoken titles.</li></ul>
